ous requirements. You may need to block access one way in order to free up another, or send cars in a loop to let a bullet train pass through.\n\nThis charming puzzle game should be easy to learn, but hard to master in order to attain all the 3-star scores. Can you perfect every level??", "short_description": "Plug the gaps in the miniature city before the vehicles crash! In this charming puzzle game, you take the role of a city planner and must perform some last-minute engineering work on a low-poly street to keep the planes, trains and automobiles on track and on time."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.davidaddis.com/?page_id=61616", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "David Addis", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.davidaddis.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "fr", "de", "it", "es", "uk", "zh_CN", "ja"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8830267167091781"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 11, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2139852780085938"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1405663724431020"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "894213716885184"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2057016198399719"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1353668919585144"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "780774380985730"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "642295451489751"}, {"status": "P